WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.410
- Michael Ealy, I've been seeing you.

00:00:02.410 --> 00:00:04.480
I can feel that you're
dying to say something.

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:07.950
You've just been moving
so much on this screen.

00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:09.640
Have you ever heard anything like this?

00:00:09.640 --> 00:00:14.573
- Yeah, you know, this is an
incredible, incredible story.

00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:20.860
Mike, that kind of hate that you describe

00:00:20.860 --> 00:00:23.280
that you feel when people look

00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:25.450
at you because they see the tattoos

00:00:25.450 --> 00:00:27.830
and everything, just for the record,

00:00:27.830 --> 00:00:30.850
this is what a lot of Black
people feel every day.

00:00:30.850 --> 00:00:35.200
And so that I understand
what you're talking about.

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:40.200
Two, Tiffany, I think
you are living proof.

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:43.787
You're kind of an angel,
to be honest with you.

00:00:43.787 --> 00:00:44.620
- Thank you.

00:00:44.620 --> 00:00:48.690
- And you're living proof
that if you can lead

00:00:48.690 --> 00:00:52.660
with humanity, respect and love,

00:00:52.660 --> 00:00:57.660
then the barrier of hate can
be broken, but it takes two.

00:00:59.820 --> 00:01:02.990
I think that's the key that
I'm taking away from this,

00:01:02.990 --> 00:01:06.760
is that both of you have some sort of

00:01:06.760 --> 00:01:09.790
mutual respect for the other.

00:01:09.790 --> 00:01:13.493
And that foundation has
led to this friendship.

00:01:14.539 --> 00:01:15.743
Kelly, this is a story.

00:01:17.190 --> 00:01:18.023
You know how you do your

00:01:18.023 --> 00:01:22.970
year wrap-up episode with great stories?

00:01:23.950 --> 00:01:25.700
I don't know how you beat this one.

